{"script": "scenario_18.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 0, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「咦？我忘了跟妳說考試期間不用做便當沒關係嗎？」", "text_idx": 168, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 24, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 185, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_18.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 1, "speaker": "桜乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「這是愛理的便當。」", "text_idx": 177, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": "櫻乃", "alt_speaker_idx": 187, "voice": "sk0352", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_18.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 2, "speaker": "桜乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「是感謝她教我念書的謝禮。我覺得考得還不錯。」", "text_idx": 173, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 23, "alt_speaker": "櫻乃", "alt_speaker_idx": 187, "voice": "sk0353", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_18.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 3, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……這樣啊。」", "text_idx": 165, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 185, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_18.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 4, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「再一下……再一下下啊熊喵小姐……」", "text_idx": 167, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": "安潔", "alt_speaker_idx": 183, "voice": "ag0282", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_18.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 5, "speaker": "ぱんにゃ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「嚕～嚕～」", "text_idx": 169, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "熊喵", "alt_speaker_idx": 189, "voice": "pn0060", "char_id": "ぱんにゃ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_18.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 6, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……為什麼都特地出來轉換心情了，還必須看到那隻動物呢？」", "text_idx": 164, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 29, "alt_speaker": "愛理", "alt_speaker_idx": 184, "voice": "ar0550", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_18.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 7, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「沒問題的，因為小熊喵是療癒系的。」", "text_idx": 174, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 190, "voice": "mu0182", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_18.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 8, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「太放鬆反而危險吧……還必須再繃緊神經一下啊。」", "text_idx": 170, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 24, "alt_speaker": "愛理", "alt_speaker_idx": 184, "voice": "ar0551", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_18.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 9, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「先不說那個，全部結束後，大家要不要聚一起慶祝一下？」", "text_idx": 166, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 27, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 185, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_18.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 10, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「聽起來很棒呢！對未來抱有希望了！」", "text_idx": 175, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": "安潔", "alt_speaker_idx": 183, "voice": "ag0283", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_18.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 11, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「好了，該回教室了。」", "text_idx": 171, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": "愛理", "alt_speaker_idx": 184, "voice": "ar0552", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_18.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 12, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "──於是。", "text_idx": 163, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 5, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_18.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 13, "speaker": "万智", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「好，這樣就全部結束了。」", "text_idx": 172, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": "萬智", "alt_speaker_idx": 191, "voice": "mc0087", "char_id": "万智"}]}
{"script": "scenario_18.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 14, "speaker": "汎用", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「辛苦了～～～！」", "text_idx": 176, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": "全班同學", "alt_speaker_idx": 182, "voice": "go040", "char_id": "汎用"}]}
{"script": "scenario_18.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 15, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "４天來雖然辛苦但也熱鬧，時間一下子就過去了。", "text_idx": 193, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 22, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
